---
---

<section class="translate" id="translate">
  <div class="wrap translate__grid">
    <div class="translate__copy">
      <h2>Talk across languages without leaving the channel</h2>
      <p class="lede">
        Run <code class="cmd">/translate chinese</code> in a channel and Yu translates each message between
        English and Chinese as people post. Use <code class="cmd">japanese</code> for Japanese.
      </p>
      <ul class="how">
        <li>
          <code class="cmd">/translate japanese Hello!</code>
          <span>Translate one message and stop there.</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <code class="cmd">/translate off</code>
          <span>Turn translation off in the current channel.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p class="fine">Translation runs on DeepL. You bring the API key, and each channel keeps its own language.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="channel" role="img" aria-label="Example channel: Yu translates an English question into Chinese and a Chinese reply into English.">
      <div class="channel__bar"># cafe-chat</div>
      <div class="channel__log" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="m">
          <span class="who">You</span>
          <span class="cmd">/translate chinese</span>
        </div>
        <div class="m m--yu">
          <span class="who">Yu Perennia <span class="app">APP</span></span>
          <p>Order received! Yu will translate between English and Chinese in this channel! 🍵</p>
        </div>
        <div class="m">
          <span class="who">mika</span>
          <p class="plain">Is the shop open today?</p>
        </div>
        <div class="m m--yu">
          <span class="who">Yu Perennia <span class="app">APP</span></span>
          <p>mika : 店今天开门吗？</p>
        </div>
        <div class="m">
          <span class="who">lin</span>
          <p class="plain">开门啦，快进来！</p>
        </div>
        <div class="m m--yu">
          <span class="who">Yu Perennia <span class="app">APP</span></span>
          <p>lin : It's open, come on in!</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="channel__foot">Example conversation</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .translate {
    --edge: var(--paper);
    --shadow-color: var(--ink);
    --focus: var(--paper);
    background: var(--cocoa);
    color: var(--paper);
    padding-block: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 6.5rem);
    border-bottom: 3px solid var(--ink);
  }
  .translate__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 0.9fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
    align-items: center;
  }
  .translate h2 {
    max-width: 14ch;
  }
  .how {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 2rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .how li {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    justify-items: start;
  }
  .how .cmd {
    border-color: var(--ink);
  }
  .fine {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 3px solid var(--paper);
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .channel {
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
    border: 3px solid var(--ink);
    box-shadow: 10px 10px 0 var(--ink);
  }
  .channel__bar {
    padding: 0.75rem 1.1rem;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .channel__log {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    background: var(--mist);
  }
  .m {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    justify-items: start;
  }
  .who {
    font-weight: 750;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .app {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-left: 0.3rem;
    padding: 0 0.35rem;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 750;
    vertical-align: 0.1em;
  }
  .m p {
    padding: 0.55rem 0.8rem;
    border: 3px solid var(--ink);
    background: var(--paper);
    box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--ink);
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .m p.plain {
    background: var(--tan);
  }
  .channel .cmd {
    border-color: var(--ink);
    background: var(--paper);
  }
  .channel__foot {
    padding: 0.6rem 1.1rem;
    border-top: 3px solid var(--ink);
    color: var(--cocoa);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 62rem) {
    .translate__grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
